{"title":"腾讯内部资源30页PPT曝光 几近满分的项目管理课程","date":"2016-08-26","content":"<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:24.0pt;\r\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-outline-level:1\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt\">腾讯内部资源<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>页<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPT</span>曝光<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:24.0pt;\r\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-outline-level:1\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt\">几近满分的项目管理课程<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:18.0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;\r\nmso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">来源：市场部网 <span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:18.0pt;\r\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;\r\nmso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">大公司的一个好处，是各个领域都有牛人，可以为你提供经验分享交流。腾讯庞大的培训体系更是保证了：如果你想学点什么东西，你总可以学到。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">项目管理是很多人的痛点。我至今印象很深刻的一个场景，是一个同事工作中被催得跺脚时，他说：<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>催催催，催得老子暴跳如雷！<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">但能做好项目管理的人，在工作中很多时候都能做到游刃有余。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">这门课程来自于在工作中有七年项目管理经验的<span lang=\"EN-US\">Cindy</span>。课程原名《项目管理，让自己更从容》。人生在世，不就是图个从容嘛。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">这门课程在公司里的课后学员评分，是几乎满分。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">在我的同事芋头出卖色相后（感谢芋头），我从<span lang=\"EN-US\">Cindy</span>处拿到了这份<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPT</span>的发布授权。每页<span lang=\"EN-US\">PPT</span>前的文字是我在听<span lang=\"EN-US\">Cindy</span>分享时的笔记和个人感受。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">1</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">、什么是项目管理？工作涉及项目管理，生活中同样涉及：婚礼、旅游、聚餐。甚至泡妞也是需要一点项目管理知识的。</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E4%B8%80.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">2</span></b><b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">、项目管理中，最费时的是第二部分：计划。</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E4%BA%8C.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">3</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">、很多人会忽略<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;W&rdquo;</span>和<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;H&rdquo;</span>的问题。其中一个原因是很多课程都有这种提炼，很多人自己乱了。</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E4%B8%89.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">4</span></b><b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">、先搞清楚<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>为什么<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>很重要，磨刀不误砍柴工。</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E5%9B%9B.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">5</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">、有女朋友的人一定很明白这个道理：<span lang=\"EN-US\">want &ne; need </span>。</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E4%BA%94.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">6</span></b><b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">、上级要求你在成本削减的情况下仍然要保质保量你怎么办？你要学习另一门课程《向上管理》。</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E5%85%AD.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">7</span></b><b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">、大多数时候，这里有<span lang=\"EN-US\">KPI</span>。</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E4%B8%83.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">8</span></b><b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">、第一点就是设计和开发经常挑战产品经理的：需求要明确。第二点市场的同学可能会比较头疼。第三点是启动时要考虑的。第四点是要考虑臣妾的能力。第五点，项目管理都是有周期的。</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E5%85%AB.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">9</span></b><b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">、对着列出这几点很重要。</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E4%B9%9D.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">10</span></b><b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">、关于干系人，宝洁的方法论是找出<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;PACE&rdquo;</span>。</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">P</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">是<span lang=\"EN-US\">Participant</span>（参与者），<span lang=\"EN-US\">A</span>是<span lang=\"EN-US\">Approver</span>（审批者），<span lang=\"EN-US\">C</span>是<span lang=\"EN-US\">Consultant</span>（顾问），<span lang=\"EN-US\">E</span>是<span lang=\"EN-US\">Executor</span>（执行者）。</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E5%8D%81.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%80.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%89.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">11</span></b><b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">、这里主要是流程立项，通常来说会召开一个启动大会。</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">12</span></b><b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">、工作分解的方法论，涉及到很多细节，需要有足够的脑力来完成这一部分。这一部分也是重中之重。</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%94.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%83.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AB.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E5%8D%81%E4%B9%9D.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%80.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">13</span></b><b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">、最大的风险有时候会来自内部：领导要求变更。</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%8C.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%89.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E4%BA%94.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E4%B8%83.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">14</span></b><b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">、有很多人可能会忽视了总结。一个项目做完了就是做完了，没有内容整理存档和个人经验提升的意识。</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AB.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E4%B9%9D.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">16</span></b><b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">、<span lang=\"EN-US\">Cindy</span>最后附上的<span lang=\"EN-US\">tips</span>。</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b style=\"line-height: 24pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201608/%E4%B8%89%E5%8D%81.png\" style=\"width: 940px; height: 416px;\" /></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"color: black; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 14pt; line-height: 24pt;\">就像开头说的，项目管理是很多人的痛点。做好项目管理能让自己省很多功夫。项目管理本身不生产价值，但是促使价值产生。</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">做好项目管理，拒绝无谓加班。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">至少，不能让别人把自己催得暴跳如雷。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\ncolor:black;mso-themecolor:text1\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 24pt;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:black;mso-themecolor:text1;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>"}